# Trust: Bastok (bastok 92): the other nations' trust NPCs read this quest's status (status reads in their own scripts,
# which stay; nothing of this quest runs there). Available: Gondebaud's 3500 (Southern San d'Oria) and Wetata's 863
# (Windurst Woods) need all three trust quests available (option 0: nothing). Accepted through Clarion Star's 434:
# Gondebaud and Wetata start nothing (Bastok's is neither available nor completed, the other two available); with
# Trust: Windurst accepted by GM, Kupipi (Heaven's Tower) plays 435, not 439 (Bastok's not completed, San d'Oria's
# available); with Trust: San d'Oria accepted by GM too, Excenmille (Northern San d'Oria) plays 893, not 897 (Bastok's
# not completed, Windurst's accepted). 435's and 893's finishes are their scripts' own (the trust learned, their
# FirstTrust var 1).
# Kupipi+1: Heaven's Tower has two Kupipis; the first (17768466) is cutscene_only, the second the one a char talks to.
lists PortBastok/Clarion_Star/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/434
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=123.7,0,92.1 lvl=5 nation=1
login
trigger Gondebaud              # the three available: 3500
finish                         # option 0: nothing
warp -23.8,2.5,-44.6 WindurstWoods
trigger Wetata                 # the three available: 863
finish                         # option 0: nothing
warp 81.5,7.5,-24.2 PortBastok
trigger Clarion_Star           # 434
finish option=2                # begun, the Blue Institute Card
warp 123.7,0,92.1 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Gondebaud              # Bastok's accepted: no event
finish-if-event
warp -23.8,2.5,-44.6 WindurstWoods
trigger Wetata                 # Bastok's accepted: no event
finish-if-event
quest Windurst.TrustWindurst accepted
warp 2,0.1,30 HeavensTower
trigger Kupipi+1               # Windurst's accepted, Bastok's accepted, San d'Oria's available: 435
finish
quest Sandoria.TrustSandoria accepted
warp -229.3,7,23 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Excenmille             # San d'Oria's accepted, Bastok's and Windurst's accepted: 893
finish
